### Normal event (expected: success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"exp31-normal-01","content":"Hello from Kafka!","failureMode":"NONE"}

### Transient failure (expected: retry then success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"exp31-retry-01","content":"Temporary error demo","failureMode":"TRANSIENT"}

### Permanent failure (expected: DLQ)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"exp31-dlq-01","content":"Permanent error demo","failureMode":"PERMANENT"}

### Duplicate event (run after Normal event)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"exp31-normal-01","content":"This content must not overwrite the first","failureMode":"NONE"}

### List successfully processed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/processed
